phil spector was prolific in the 1960s  producing hit after hit for stars like  tina turner  the ronettes and the righteous brothers  [Music]  he racked up 20 top 40 singles between  1961  and 65 and later worked with the beatles  on their final album  and then john lennon and george harrison  on solo projects  [Music]  his pioneering wall of sound technique  saw him layer several instruments  to give an orchestral feel to a song it  transformed  pop music you can't just say that phil  spector  was a great record producer which he was  or you just can't say he was a killer  which he was so let's ignore his  previous work  we have to be able to hold more than one  thought in our head at the same time  and phil spector was a great artist who  just became a wacko  and in the process of being a wacko  killed a woman  spector's life was blighted by  addictions to alcohol and drugs  and in the 1980s and 90s he became a  recluse  and hardly worked in music in 2003 he  was arrested for murder  after actress lana clarkson was found  shot dead at his californian mansion  spectre was convicted at a 2009 retrial  and jailed for 19 years he was 81 years  old  and would have been eligible for parole  in three years time  ended brady sky news
 

